    "active": false,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「にゃはは。『番長』とか、そんな愉快なもんじゃないわさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしは退屈な授業を脱けだして、静かで落ちつける場所を探してこの屋上に辿りついたわさ。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「気がついたら、同じような境遇の子が『わんさか』集まってたけどね～？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしはべつに、この屋上の支配者ってわけじゃないから。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「勝手に『まとめ役』みたいにされてるけどね～、わりと不本意だわさ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「とはいえ、そんなあたしを頼ってくれる子もいる。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「家にも学校にも味方がいなくて、ひとりで泣くしかないような子がね？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「湖南やこちゃん、だっけ。こっちも、あんたの噂はいろいろ聞いてるわさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「君咲学院でいちばんの問題児だってね、かっこいいね～♪」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「でもお願いだから、屋上には手ぇださないでくれない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ここは……」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「どこにも行き場がない、帰れる場所もない、そんな子たちがほっと一息つくことができる居場所なの」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ただそれだけの、安らげる場所であってほしい」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/expressionless",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「息苦しいこの学院で、それでも必死に喘ぎながらがんばってる子たちから、この居場所まで奪うようなら……。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「あたしは、容赦しないわさ」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/normal",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「湖南ちゃん、あんたは台風の目だよ～う。暴風で、みんなのか細い吐息を消し飛ばしちゃう。」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「そんな子にいられちゃ迷惑だから、穏便に立ち去ってくれない？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/sad",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「ね？　あたしが『お願い』してるうちに、言うことを聞いてちょうだい？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "ぎん",
    "text": "「頼むから、あたしに刀を抜かせないで」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": false,
