    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「はっ！　情けないわね『番長』っ、お涙ちょうだいの話であたしの同情を買おうってわけ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「でも残念でしたっ！　あたしはね、この屋上を拠点にするって決めたのよ！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "left",
    "character": 62,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/angry",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -4,
      "y": 460
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「他人の事情なんて知ったこっちゃないわ！　あたしが主役よ、この世界の！」"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "やこ",
    "text": "「文句があるなら実力行使してみなさいよ、ぶらさげてる長物が泣くわよっ？」"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "right",
    "character": 61,
    "dress": "old-past",
    "pose": 0,
    "active": true,
    "expression": "old-past_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": -30,
      "y": 524
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
